g) who grabs my quest item and 'ports to the up starcase.  As I move towards hi
m he rests for a while the 'ports in smacks me around a few times then 'ports b
ack to the staircase.  When I finally get to the staircase to hand him his ass
on a stick, I get "Lord Surtur escapes upstairs" and the whole thing starts ove
r again. As you can imagine, this annoys me to no end.

